A line below an empty div after a first-block plus is not lazy

```
::: d
- d
  - e
    - +
  :::
after
.
<div class="d">
  <ul>
    <li>d
      <ul>
        <li>e
          <ul>
            <li>+</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <div>

      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>after</p>
</div>
```

```
- d
  - +
  :::
after
.
<ul>
  <li>d
    <ul>
      <li>
        <div>

        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>after</p>
```

```
- d
  - +
  ::: note
after
.
<ul>
  <li>d
    <ul>
      <li>
        <aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">

        </aside>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>after</p>
```

